    
    BankAccount → base class (deposit, withdraw, balance).
    SavingsAccount → child class (inherits from BankAccount).
    InterestMixin → adds interest calculation.
    NotificationMixin → adds user alerts/notifications.
    Combines Inheritance + Mixins in one program.
    Takes user input (name, balance, interest rate).
    rovides menu-driven options: Deposit, Withdraw, Add Interest, Show Balance, Exit.
    Demonstrates real-world banking system using OOP.
    Shows separation of core logic (BankAccount) vs extra features (Mixins).
    Teaches reusability, modularity, and scalability in OOP design.